stateDiagram-v2
    direction LR
    [*] --> Evaluate: InitiateAuth / RespondToAuthChallenge

    state "DefineAuthChallenge" as Evaluate
    state "VerifyAuthChallengeResponse" as Verify
    Evaluate --> Fail: user not found<br/>or a non-custom challenge in the session
    Evaluate --> IssueTokens: last answer correct
    Evaluate --> Fail: 3 wrong answers
    Evaluate --> CustomChallenge: otherwise

    CustomChallenge --> Verify: client answers with the token
    Verify --> Evaluate: answerCorrect = true / false

    IssueTokens --> [*]: JWTs returned
    Fail --> [*]: NotAuthorizedException → HTTP 401
